          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆಭಾರಿ (ābhāri) is from Sanskrit ābhāra, \"a burden\", with the ending of one who has it: the grateful person carries the weight of a kindness."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
