            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮರೆಯಬೇಡಿ (mareyabēḍi) is native Dravidian: mare, \"to forget\", (DEDR 4760, with Telugu maṟacu), and bēḍi, the polite \"do not\", from bēḍa, \"not wanted\" (DEDR 5528)."
            }
