          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Grandson, granddaughter? (ಮೊಮ್ಮಗ, ಮೊಮ್ಮಗಳು.) Relative? (ಸಂಬಂಧಿಕ.) Neighbours? (ನೆರೆಯವರು.) Uncle? (ಮಾವ.) Address? (ವಿಳಾಸ.) Birthday? (ಹುಟ್ಟುಹಬ್ಬ.) Wedding? (ಮದುವೆ.) Home town? (ಊರು.) Language? (ಭಾಷೆ.) School, college, office? (ಶಾಲೆ, ಕಾಲೇಜು, ಕಚೇರಿ.) Job? (ಉದ್ಯೋಗ.) English? (ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
